# Docs agent navigation

Before broad search:

1. Follow `AGENTS.md` read order.
2. Resolve topics via `meta/routing.md` or `meta/catalog/topics.yaml`.
3. Open hub README (`domains/README.md`, domain README, or `guides/...`) then canonical deep-dive.
4. Cite markdown paths in answers.

## Priority
- Prefer canonical map/playbook/README over long mid-file excerpts.
- Prefer markdown guides over `resources/**/*.pdf`.
- Domain maturity: prefer Stable unless user asks otherwise (`domains/README.md`).
- Prefer `meta/` over stub redirects at `AGENT-ROUTING.md`, `catalog/`, `agent-eval/`.

## Overlaps
- Technical how-to → `domains/`
- Career/monetization → `guides/03-career-skills/`
- Full split table → `meta/domain-guide-map.md`
- Life theory → `guides/04-lifestyle-os/health/` (+ well-being)
- User’s own logs → `personal/` only when asked

## Learning & hormones (shortcuts)
- Learning methods → `guides/03-career-skills/productivity/meta-skills/learning-os-framework.md`
- Hormones overview → `guides/04-lifestyle-os/health/endocrine-hormone-map.md`
- Hormone control → `guides/04-lifestyle-os/health/endocrine-control-playbook.md`
- Health theory hub → `guides/04-lifestyle-os/health/` (records → `personal/`)

## Long files
Use **Agent SUMMARY** at top of deep-dives when present; jump to relevant `##` sections.

## Vietnamese content
Khi tạo context/content tiếng Việt: **đúng ngữ cảnh, đọc dễ hiểu**. Không dịch cứng từ Anh; không chồng viết tắt/jargon. Thuật ngữ Anh lần đầu giải thích bằng tiếng Việt. Skill: `docs-navigation`.

## Safety
No fabricated medical diagnosis. Lifestyle content is educational. Clinical symptoms → advise professional care.
